+| `t33` | M | 0.80 | `t33/sync-audit.md:15,41,280` |
+| `t34` | M | 0.80 | `sync-audit.md`·`-2`·`-3` 머리 |
+| `t38` | M | 0.80 (PASS **0.830**) | `t38/sync-audit.md:11,12` |
